J1 / J1a originally by James Bowman (https://github.com/jamesbowman/swapforth), BSD-3-Clause.
Files under `cpu/j1/j1a/` and `cpu/j1/uart.v` carry that provenance.

`j1b.v`, `stack.v`, and `common.h` are the 32-bit core from AFCK_J1B_FORTH `original/j1b/verilog` (same BSD text).

Console images are built with fsoc `fsys` (`fsys/kernel/j1a`, `fsys/kernel/j1b`), not a vendored SwapForth tree.
